                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2835943,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Another theory for the regular appearance and disappearance of birds was that they spent winter hidden in mud till the weather changed and food became abundant again.",
                "meta": {
