                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2835971,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The theory that some birds hibernate persisted until experiments were done on caged birds in the 1940s, which demonstrated that birds have no hibernation instinct.",
